{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR EQUIPMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RuneLight has dozens of powerful and game changing equipment pieces to collect. Swap out, mix, and match equipment to make a wide variety of builds and synergies.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393910/extras/equip_example.png?t=1740284184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR WEAPON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RuneLight is all about crafting powerful builds, and allows you to customize your weapon's stats to match it. With dozens of weapon modifiers increasing a variety of stats, you can make your weapons fit your own needs<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393910/extras/weapon_example.png?t=1740284184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393910/extras/Project_1.gif?t=1740284184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER FUSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each equipment piece can be fused into one of two paths. Double down on powerful items, discover new synergies, and perfect your build</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393910/extras/upgrade_example_1.gif?t=1740284184\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT POWERFUL</strong>\u00a0<strong>ELEMENTALS</strong><br>RuneLight has 3 maps, each with a completely different set of elemental enemies. Fight the tough forest elementals, take down the quick coastal elementals, and bring down the ghostly temple elementals\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Punching Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2393910/a7c717478aa7139de2d4c69f8456e8